    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

This is the charter body inside `constitution.html` — the preamble, the
articles and their provisions. Version 1.0 was first publicly released on
August 3, 2026 and frozen on August 13, 2026. Under Article XIII it may be
amended only by an explicit, dated, versioned decision carrying a statement of
purpose; it is never silently edited in place.

The canonical Markdown, the version history and adaptation guidance live in a
separate repository:

    https://github.com/pyaeger/frontier-constitution

You may fork and adapt the charter under CC BY-SA 4.0. Doing so requires no
approval from Patrick Yaeger and implies no endorsement by him. His private
knowledge system, not this repository, remains the canonical governing source.

