`og.png` and `og.svg` are social link-preview cards carrying the MyFrontierAI
wordmark. They are branding, not artwork for reuse, and are reserved.

=======================================================================
IF YOU ARE UNSURE
=======================================================================

Take the charter text under CC BY-SA 4.0 and the code under MIT. Do not take
the names or the look. If something is genuinely ambiguous, ask rather than
assume — this project exists to demonstrate a legible audit trail, and a
license file that has to be guessed at would undercut the point.
